TITLE Albite kinetics + fixed-pressure H2S(g); track Ba at steps 10 and 70

SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH   2 charge
    units mol/kgw
    Fe(3) 0.004
    Fe(2) 0.004

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure true
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5

KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 10*10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -totals Ba

END